-- Tournament desk seed: Luck Party first, plus the candidate sites from the
-- 2026-10-02 research. Data, not schema: run after
-- migrations/20261002080000_tournament_desk.sql. Safe to re-run (upserts).
-- Maintained directly; no generator is checked in. Keep the upserts and the
-- delete-before-insert snapshot pattern idempotent when editing.
