-- Luck Party games. categories = the tabs a game is in on 2026-10-02, parsed
-- from the public lobby pages' embedded data (Hot 48, Featured 55, Party Time
-- 12, Hit It 6). Games seen only in the September screenshots carry no current
-- tab; their September eligibility is kept on those events' links.
