x 4% edge; double it if the min bet is 0.20", "bankroll_sweeps": 15, "time_estimate_min": 25, "ev_note": "Prize equity unknown: the first-5 slots were probably filled overnight, but ''closest to 9.1x'' stays open until the end. Treat it as a free roll on spins you take anyway for the raffle.", "confidence": "low", "data_gaps": ["line count and min SC bet of each Hit It game (paytable)", "whether ''closest'' means absolute distance or from below", "how fast the first 5 hits happen (check the in-app board first; if 5 rows already show 9.1x, skip)"], "risk": "Negative EV on its own (~4% of what you spin). One account, no scripts; stop at the 200 spins.", "stack_with": ["Weekly Spin Raffle (200 SC spins = 1 ticket)"], "log_command": "Log tournament entry luckparty hit-the-multiplier-hit-it-category 2026-10-02: spins <n>, best multiplier <x>, closest to 9.1 <x>, games <names>"}'::jsonb, now())
